# Compat lane PR-4: the pure landing-order solver over compatibility findings. Derived at read time
# (Stage-0 audit: obligations are a deterministic function of findings), shadow telemetry only —
# nothing persisted, nothing rendered. One gate per file (see 246/247 for the lane's earlier gates).
# GATE-HYGIENE: description strings must contain NO dollar-sign and NO backtick (set -u in the runner).
register_gate "tests/test_compat_order.py" "COMPAT ORDER SOLVER GATE: PASS" "compat landing plan: pure deterministic order plus successor revision work, cycles never linearized" "compat S3b keeps _compat_order.solve_landing_order unchanged as the pure graph primitive and adds solve_landing_plan as a pure work-plan layer. Evidence-backed consumer_call_mismatch edges are hard, require successor revision and reanalysis, and set merge_eligible_unchanged false. Acyclic chains emit hold, predecessor land, successor update, reanalysis, and land-after-clear steps. Independent components remain separate. Cycles emit cycle_coordination_required with no order or landing step; mutual hard pairs emit revision_required_no_safe_unchanged_order. Rebase and Unknown stay non-Clear. The plan accepts exact PR change ids only and emits bounded content-free codes, never SHAs, paths, bodies, parser text, argument values, fingerprints, or ignored input fields. Malformed input never raises and makes repository-level classification Unknown. Repeated and shuffled inputs produce byte-identical JSON." "compat landing plan: existing order regression suite plus positional_shortfall, missing_required_kwonly, callee_removed, unchanged-order distinction, successor merge eligibility false, N-PR chain work steps, independent clusters, cycle without fabricated order or landing, mutual hard, hard plus soft merge, rebase, Unknown, malformed and non-sequence never-crash, shuffle determinism, exact JSON, and content-free sentinels. Gate 248." 16
